    {
      "key": "StartMenuClassicLayout",
      "label": "Start Menu: Previous Layout",
      "tip": "Reverts to the Start Menu layout used before Windows 11's newer redesign. Uses an internal, undocumented Windows feature-flag override (not an officially supported setting) - a future Windows update could change or stop honoring this.",
